{"1165870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Mahou Arms","steam_appid":1165870,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[1855550],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mahou Arms<\/i> is an anime-inspired character-action hack and slash that tells the story of a magical girl paramilitary group fighting back against an unknown force invading Earth.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1165870\/extras\/fd7ce03f01ae6b145c99ecb839dd707d.poster.avif?t=1785203443\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1165870\/extras\/fd7ce03f01ae6b145c99ecb839dd707d.mp4?t=1785203443\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human race is on the brink of total annihilation by the mysterious force known as the ‘Locks. GARDA, a global paramilitary organization, has finally discovered the means to fight back: magical girls. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your small, ragtag group toward victory at all costs. Get to know your  “soldiers” and take direct control on the battlefield to reclaim Earth. Good luck.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Character Action Combat<\/strong> – Control a magical girl and fight with a variety of moves to take out your opponents!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Gripping Story<\/strong> – Follow the struggle of GARDA and get to know the magical girls, along with a number of other characters! <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Playable Magical Girls<\/strong>  – Experience their unique movesets and playstyles!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Quests and Alternative Gameplay<\/stron